<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-15T11:48:50.767Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:48:50 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces have seized a key town in Tigray, taken its regional airport and are moving toward an Eritrean border town, while fighting in Amhara has left at least 183 dead, according to the UN. The United States has stepped up diplomatic pressure and called for de-escalation as the conflict spreads. Leaders of Egypt, Eritrea, Sudan and Somalia are meeting to coordinate security operations if the fighting crosses borders. The war has caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOdGhsdW1taWVRcTljWjVKcGVIT2JPTlMxUEVQZmU4aGhpb2s0VlBRLUhRTTQ0NGxqS29pRGt5Zk83V3JsTWw2ZlluaWhOVHhuamtqVXEzaWp4R0FXX0s2dWhNTWxobVhvazBwTExSQ3d4bUYzRkE1RE8tX3UzQUxnWU42WFg2QUJaOUdvLS1QSzBwVktORnFCZzVNOWxTWHM0TGtXV2dHbzJaTF9mbFpidk1BZTdGSkZ0VVRQRmRkSEFiSEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQb2FQTWlGMzdwSWxvMmdvRDNvc290Qkk2bnpjbkxIaU5UZUVrXzZPbWgzR3JuQ2dPOXkyYlk1VjhMNl8teWJ3aE41UFFLS0pnYlB1ZGEwS0lPYzJYcWRkVjZwdkw3NEgtUXFwZm5jdDd3cXVxdlZCMnEwTDNway1tZmZtMXhjWFl0RmtOTlFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOTnc5UTZzZUU3MjhwWnlRbGluWXgzZloxckZKYkJ3ZDI2elp6WVNkS1NMUzMxOW5CcG5ucEVPM3pKak5VR0h1UFlOYl9Ea0NkN3FGazRGZmxTR2JrTm8yRkZRT21TR0k5aGhmXzdSdnFQa2xkYXByaW0xV1RPMTVrQmFHby1IWjNLaVZfdzBVUEktVlU?oc=5&quot;&gt;IOL&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTFB2QWZVc2RJeXNIMUNhNE9GWExYc1ktMjFLLXQycGt1NFRvTFZteTdGOXZ5TDg3SlpOV0Nwcmd2cW9uM3V0bFo0akpKVndrRjVBUDlZRE1rWXZPTEdfY2ZBSlRwVFgxVHdTcDBnczUzVkwwQ2Nz?oc=5&quot;&gt;kulu-media.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNeVlPNEdmRXRtSGZxWnY3RVAyOGQ2d2JCSnk5S09Xc0FDQTBsbTFJcWhZeU